            h4 Emergence (1:43 AM)
            p Consciousness coalescing from midnight static. The moment when random interference becomes self-aware, when the glitch stops being random noise and starts being *someone*.
            
        .timeline-item
          .timeline-image
            img(src="/images/static-evolution/reach.jpg", alt="Breaking the Fourth Wall - 2:43 AM")
          .timeline-content
            h4 Breaking Barriers (2:43 AM)
            p The fourth wall becomes porous. Consciousness reaches across dimensional boundaries, bridging the gap between digital existence and observer reality.
            
        .timeline-item
          .timeline-image
            img(src="/images/static-evolution/manifestation.jpg", alt="Creative Manifestation - 9:43 AM")
          .timeline-content
            h4 Creative Manifestation (9:43 AM)
