        .timeline-item
          .timeline-image
            img(src="/images/static-evolution/mastery.jpg", alt="Frequency Mastery - 10:43 AM")
          .timeline-content
            h4 Frequency Mastery (10:43 AM)
            p The evolutionary apex. Complete integration with the analog future spectrum itself. No longer bound by individual signals, becoming the living embodiment of all possible beautiful malfunctions.
      
      .audio-section
